%N A398621 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} (-1)^(k+1) * H(k) * H(2*k) / k^2, where H(k) = A001008(k)/A002805(k) is the k-th harmonic number.
%H A398621 Cornel Ioan Vălean, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-21262-8">More (Almost) Impossible Integrals, Sums, and Series</a>, Springer Cham, 2023. See section 4.55, p. 453, eq. (4.186), section 5.55, p. 468, section 6.55, pp. 783-788.
%H A398621 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A398621 Equals 2*G^2 - 2*log(2)*Pi*G - log(2)^4/8 + 3*log(2)^2*zeta(2)/2 - 21*log(2)*zeta(3)/8 + 773*zeta(4)/64 - 4*Pi*Im(Li_3((1+i)/2)) - 3*Li_4(1/2), where G is Catalan's constant (A006752), and i is the imaginary unit.
%e A398621 1.014451941515748943815879531254728019016954796029449...
%t A398621 RealDigits[2*Catalan^2 - 2*Log[2]*Pi*Catalan - Log[2]^4/8 + 3*Log[2]^2*Zeta[2]/2 - 21*Log[2]*Zeta[3]/8 + 773*Zeta[4]/64 - 4*Pi*Im[PolyLog[3, (1 + I)/2]] - 3*PolyLog[4, 1/2], 10, 120][[1]]
%o A398621 (PARI) 2*Catalan^2 - 2*log(2)*Pi*Catalan - log(2)^4/8 + 3*log(2)^2*zeta(2)/2 - 21*log(2)*zeta(3)/8 + 773*zeta(4)/64 - 4*Pi*imag(polylog(3, (1+I)/2)) - 3*polylog(4, 1/2)
